From 8c6e471a71056abf000e0cf5f969b84714b59a06 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: arena-agent <arena-agent@localhost>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 08:46:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] S05: fix three upstream regressions (PR #381/#382 fallout)

1. intrinsics.rs emit_avx_map_fma_inner (None,None) arm: a pending VLFOLD
   load on the SCALE operand was read through the value's never-written home
   slot (vfmadd132pd 80(%rsp) on streamed three_stream maps); consume the
   parked source operand instead. Fixes vectorize_map_expr_tree:oracle.
2. load_op_fuse.rs fuse_load_into_alu copy-bridged commutative form: the
   replacement 'mov C,B; op mem,B' clobbers the folded memory operand's
   address register when B is one of its families (nested double-loop
   miscompile, k_nested_rt_inner 90 vs 1980). Bail when (b_bit & addr)!=0.
3. callee_saves.rs eliminate_unused_callee_saves_fpo: removing a leading push
   shifts every %rsp-relative data reference (va save areas, overflow
   pointers, spill slots) by 8 bytes; the safe-gate only bailed on and/%xmm
   lines. Bail on any non-adjust %rsp reference. Fixes
   va_arg_wide_struct:oracle (ll/big).
---
 src/backend/x86/codegen/intrinsics.rs         | 16 ++++++++++++---
 .../codegen/peephole/passes/callee_saves.rs   | 20 ++++++++++---------
 .../codegen/peephole/passes/load_op_fuse.rs   |  7 +++++++
 3 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

